// A function of the file named as one of the AppServer's language -- IsAlpha,
// Found -- is refused: its compiler has those as its own ("C2022 Redefinition
// of language function"). A User Function's name is the AppServer's U_LEN.
Static Function IsAlpha(cS)
Return !Empty(cS)

Static Function Found()
Return .F.

User Function Len()
Return IsAlpha("x") .And. Found()
